  "name": "The Tin Top Restaurant & Oyster Bar",
  "description": "Located in Bon Secour along the Bon Secour River, The Tin Top Restaurant & Oyster Bar has been serving exceptional Gulf seafood and premium aged steaks since 2004. Founded by Bob Hallmark with a passion for cooking and Southern hospitality, Tin Top offers the finest casual dining experience with fresh oysters, Gulf shrimp, Royal Reds, hand-cut steaks, and seasonal house favorites. The restaurant features a relaxed coastal atmosphere with indoor and patio seating, scratch-made dishes, and a thoughtful selection of beers, wines, and cocktails. Known for exceptional ingredients treated with respect and genuine Southern hospitality, Tin Top is a local favorite and coastal dining destination.",
